    {
      "v": 4,
      "zh": "七雷发声之后，我正要写出来，就听见从天上有声音说：「七雷所说的，你要封上，不可写出来。」",
      "en": "When the seven thunders spoke, I was preparing to write, but[NOTE:1] just then[NOTE:2] I heard a voice from heaven say, “Seal up what the seven thunders spoke and do not write it down.”",
