    {
      "v": 6,
      "zh": "指着那创造天和天上之物，地和地上之物，海和海中之物，直活到永永远远的，起誓说：「不再有时日了（或译：不再耽延了）。」",
      "en": "and swore by the one who lives forever and ever, who created heaven and what is in it, and the earth and what is in it, and the sea and what is in it, “There will be no more delay![NOTE:1]",
